 oedema:{n:"Peripheral & sacral oedema",p:"120, 147, 318",gm:"cvs",
  how:"Press firmly over the shins/ankles and sacrum and look for pitting; note extent and whether unilateral or bilateral.",
  look:"Bilateral pitting: heart failure, nephrotic syndrome, liver disease. Unilateral: DVT, venous disease. Brawny, slow-pitting oedema: chronic venous stasis."},
